  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#968;</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></math>, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>,&nbsp;is equal to&nbsp;",
