      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>&#968;</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>&#968;</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math>",
