  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>.</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>&#160;</mi></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Applying integration by parts, we get<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>&#968;</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#968;</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math>, where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi></math>&nbsp;is the constant of integration.</p>",
